Follow module ownership, ECS API design, networking, and verification guidance.

Read `.agents/rules/csharp-writing-conventions.md`, `.agents/rules/ecs-writing-conventions.md`, and the `csharp-style` skill plus `references/dependency-injection.md`.

Marker: wrap the smallest changed block in `// Arcane-Edit: <old> > <new>`, or `// Arcane-Start` / `// Arcane-End` for added lines. Skip it inside `Modules/Arcane/**` and `Content.Arcane.*`. Required inside `Content.Trauma.*` and `*.Trauma.cs`, since those sync. Never write `Trauma - ` or `<Trauma>` on our own change; see `.cursor/rules/core.mdc`.

`[Dependency] private Type _field = default!;` without `readonly`. Reusable `EntityQuery<T>` and `HashSet<T>` over per-call allocation. Mark types `sealed`, `static`, `abstract`, or `[Virtual]`.
